# AI context folder path
# Enter the absolute path to the folder where you store your logs, specs, and design files.
# This folder should live OUTSIDE the repository so git never tracks your content.
#
# Examples:
#   D:\AI-Context\
#   C:\Users\YourName\Desktop\ai-context\
#   D:\Work\ai-input\
#
# Leave blank to fall back to the context/ folder inside this repo.
D:\GitLab Workspace\context for AI
